eakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":2986979650,"text":"現状、昨日の「笠かぶり犬」が守っている拠点がまだあるので、特に注意して対処する必要があります。","nextNodeIds":[400320106]},{"nodeId":400320106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3540466978,"text":"パイモンがつけそうなあだ名。","nextNodeIds":[400320107]},{"nodeId":400320107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1354366122,"text":"おい！オイラはそんなあだ名つけないぞ！オイラだったら…","nextNodeIds":[400320108]},{"nodeId":400320108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3605461514,"text":"えっと——「刀持ち犬」だ！","nextNodeIds":[400320109]},{"nodeId":400320109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":1954812506,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[400320110]},{"nodeId":400320110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":2258707610,"text":"とにかく、そこに同じ装置を配置しました。効果があるといいのですが。","nextNodeIds":[400320111]},{"nodeId":400320111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2174040898,"text":"うぅ…無視するなよ！","nextNodeIds":[400320112]},{"nodeId":400320112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":1122625322,"text":"では、頼みましたよ。","nextNodeIds":[400320113]},{"nodeId":400320113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":1294191594,"text":"他に質問はありますか？","nextNodeIds":[400320114]},{"nodeId":400320114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":114888018,"text":"場所の情報は確かなの？","nextNodeIds":[400320115]},{"nodeId":400320115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":741558298,"text":"はい、問題ありません。すでに現場に行って調査済みです。","nextNodeIds":[400320116]},{"nodeId":400320116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":475978826,"text":"じゃあ、なんで龍二は今回、オイラたちと一緒に行かないんだ？","nextNodeIds":[400320117]},{"nodeId":400320117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":259052042,"text":"一緒に行きたいのはやまやまですが、あいにく今日は珊瑚所長から他の任務を任されています。","nextNodeIds":[400320118]},{"nodeId":400320118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":3281775698,"text":"簡単に言うと、所長は「笠かぶり犬」について少々考えがあるようです。ですので、その調査を頼まれました。","nextNodeIds":[400320119]},{"nodeId":400320119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3108779378,"text":"「刀持ち犬」。","nextNodeIds":[400320120]},{"nodeId":400320120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":2888914418,"text":"「笠かぶり犬」。","nextNodeIds":[400320121,400320124]},{"nodeId":400320121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":805976034,"text":"「笠付き刀犬」。","nextNodeIds":[400320122]},{"nodeId":400320122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":1221599282,"text":"変なあだ名ですね。","nextNodeIds":[400320123]},{"nodeId":400320123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":914658362,"text":"なんだそのあだ名、変だぞ。","nextNodeIds":[400320125]},{"nodeId":400320125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":2151222234,"text":"…もういいです。いっそ「黒い影」と呼びましょう。","nextNodeIds":[400320126]},{"nodeId":400320126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"龍二","textMapHash":2216542978,"text":"何はともあれ、動物たちのことは頼みましたよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":400320124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3005673474,"text":"もうやめよう…","nextNodeIds":[400320125]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4003201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT"